@host = http://localhost:5251

### 1. Seeded data (200)
GET {{host}}/api/ticket-categories
Accept: application/json

### 2. Create category (201)
POST {{host}}/api/ticket-categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Standing", "capacity": 50 }

### 3. Reserve tickets (201) - replace {id} with an id from step 1/2
POST {{host}}/api/ticket-categories/{id}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 3 }

### 4. Over-reserve the seeded "Backstage" category (capacity 2) -> 422
POST {{host}}/api/ticket-categories/{backstageId}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 5 }

### 5. Unknown category -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/ticket-categories/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 6. Delete (204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/ticket-categories/{id}
